      "translationZh": "该规范现以草案形式提供。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f251a227bcc0aaa1",
      "translationZh": "有关变更的详细概述，请参阅 2026-07-28 草案变更日志。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0bee66344bf3dc4",
      "translationZh": "致用户和实现者：本规范尚未定稿。从 RC 到最终发布之间可能会引入变更。各 SDK 将按各自的节奏采用此版本，而旧版规范可能仍会继续使用一段时间，具体时长尚不确定。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a36330686d6ad2e",
